1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:02,902
Do you know how our salary cycle

2
00:00:02,922 --> 00:00:04,222
currently works?

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,702
Today, merit recommendations are based on

4
00:00:10,722 --> 00:00:13,041
projected market salary movement.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,124
That means we use estimated market movement,

6
00:00:16,144 --> 00:00:19,420
rather than the actual movement in market salaries.

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,661
And our bonus is based on estimated

8
00:00:21,681 --> 00:00:24,188
company performance against KPIs.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,948
To better align with market best practices,

10
00:00:29,968 --> 00:00:33,007
we are shifting the timing of our salary cycle.

11
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,529
Going forward, our cycle will shift

12
00:00:38,549 --> 00:00:41,720
from the January–December timing to March–April.

13
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,438
This means your bonus will be paid

14
00:00:43,458 --> 00:00:44,932
in the March payroll.

15
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:49,045
And any new merit increase will be effective April 1,

16
00:00:49,065 --> 00:00:51,473
and reflected in the April payroll.

17
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,402
But here is the important part:

18
00:00:55,422 --> 00:00:58,752
your performance appraisal cycle does not change.

19
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,409
Performance appraisal will continue as usual,

20
00:01:01,429 --> 00:01:04,296
and the cycle will still close in December.

21
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:09,376
So, your performance cycle stays the same.

22
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,041
What changes is the timing

23
00:01:11,061 --> 00:01:13,533
of the bonus and the merit increase.

24
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,590
This shift lets us make salary decisions

25
00:01:18,610 --> 00:01:21,020
using more relevant market information,

26
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,007
and align our cycle more closely

27
00:01:23,027 --> 00:01:25,103
with market best practices.

28
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:26,245
Have questions?

29
00:01:26,265 --> 00:01:28,668
HR will be ready to answer them.
